  {
   "id": "sunset-motel-282298@major-2025-09-11",
   "gameId": "sunset-motel-282298",
   "displayName": "Caravan Update – Very Soon!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-09-11T12:40:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "🌅 Sunset Motel – Caravan Update Devlog",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’re in the final testing phase! 🚀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That’s right — the Caravan Update is almost at the finish line. We’re doing the very last internal checks, and there’s really just a little time left before we can share it with you. ⏳💛",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To celebrate, we’ve prepared a small devlog. This way, you can see not only what’s planned but also what we’re already testing in-game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🚐 Caravan Interior Design",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "With brand-new furniture, flooring, and decoration options, you’ll be able to completely renovate abandoned caravans.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🛻 Caravan Exterior Overhaul",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Rusty bodies, broken windows, faded paint — restore them all and give your caravan a fresh, new look!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎥 Outdoor Cinema",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You can now set up an open-air cinema at your motel!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Guests will enjoy movies under the stars, while you showcase your own style through decoration.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🔧 Internal Testing & New Mechanics",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Right now, the team is testing these features. From performance optimizations to fine-tuning new mechanics, we’re making sure everything runs smoothly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "In short: the update is almost here! 🚀",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎬 What’s Next",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Very soon, we’ll be announcing the release date. Until then, enjoy these previews as a taste of what’s coming.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Sunset Motel Team 💛",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
