  {
   "id": "sunset-motel-282298@1",
   "gameId": "sunset-motel-282298",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 1",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-06-14T15:00:31.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello Sunset Motel residents!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’ve been closely listening to your feedback and have been working behind the scenes to fix some issues and improve your stay. Here’s what’s been addressed in this hotfix:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. 🧳 The rare issue where the suitcase wouldn’t arrive has been fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. 🍷 The alcohol serving task at the bar has been made more clear and user-friendly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. 🍽️ A rare bug where food wasn’t being served has been resolved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. 🇪🇸 Some words in the Spanish localization have been corrected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. 🛠️ General optimizations were made to improve FPS in certain areas.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. 🚗 Fixed a bug where the car purchase button in the mechanic shop wasn’t working.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. 🧍‍♂️ Fixed broken customer models in medium and low graphic settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. 🌑 Corrected the overly dark shadows on medium settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "9. 🌿 Grass rendering issues in low settings have been resolved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "10. 🗺️ Fixed a bug where players could get stuck outside the map by accident.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks for playing and for all your helpful reports — you’re helping make Sunset Motel the coziest roadside stop in town. 🛎️💛",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay tuned, more improvements and features are on the way!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
